WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.240
Matatagi!

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:06.900
Stop them!

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:12.900
You won't get through!

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.950
Guys! Remember our training!

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.370
He's coming!

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:20.620
Don't stand in front of me!

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.120
I'll stop it-

00:00:25.320 --> 00:00:26.380
Shindou-san!

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.700
That was unnecessary!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:37.970
I could've stopped that shoot easily!

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:40.470
Did you guys see that?

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:43.670
We're playing against these people?

00:00:43.670 --> 00:00:46.650
As expected of Korea's breeze! He's super fast!

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:48.560
Also, that power of his...

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:54.860
If I'd missed the timing for even a second, both the ball and I would have been sent flying into the goal...

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:00.490
From the looks of this, we'll have to do as Shindou-san said.

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:03.540
<i>The three of us will have to handle it ourselves.</i>

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:08.080
<i>This is the best choice we can make if we want to win.</i>

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.550
Lee Chun-yoon...

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:14.880
I won't lose to you!

00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:51.940
<b>A Small Change</b>

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:57.000
Football Frontier International Vision 2's Asia preliminaries!

00:02:57.000 --> 00:03:06.000
The match between Japan's Inazuma Japan and Korea's Fire Dragon opens with an eye-widening shoot by Korea's breeze, Lee Chun-yoon!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:12.960
Inazuma Japan managed to block it with a cut from Shindou, but not before Fire Dragon showed off its speed and power!

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.920
The score is 0-0!

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:17.460
Which team will make the first goal?!

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.380
The game resumes with the throw-in by Fire Dragon!

00:03:23.070 --> 00:03:25.050
Matatagi steals the ball!

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.470
He dribbles up the field!

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:29.820
That's it, Nii-chan!

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:30.480
Go!

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.190
I can't afford to lose this game!

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:39.370
Not only for the money that Coach promised me, but for Yuuta and Shun, too!

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:41.150
You got into a fight?

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:45.100
You know Takuya who lives next door, right?

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.370
That guy was making fun of you!

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:50.910
It was about your exhibition match with the Teikoku Eleven.

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:56.750
That Takuya called you a loser who can't even catch a ball...

00:03:58.350 --> 00:04:00.340
I was so mad...

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:04.430
Nii-chan, you have to score a goal in your next game!

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:06.140
Shun...

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:07.890
Watch me, Shun!

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.270
I'll score a goal for you!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.800
What's with that dribbling?

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:15.940
Is he a total beginner?

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.820
You won't get through us with that dribbling!

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:20.100
The ball is stolen from Matatagi!

00:04:20.100 --> 00:04:21.190
So close!

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.780
That's what you get for trying to show off on your own.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:27.200
Is it Fire Dragon's turn to attack once more?!

00:04:27.670 --> 00:04:29.620
This is turning into a one-sided game!

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.200
Inazuma Japan can't even touch the ball!

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:38.840
I guess taking on the world isn't going to be that easy, just because we practiced a little...

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:41.050
This is within my expectations.

00:04:41.050 --> 00:04:42.840
Fire Dragon's pretty awesome.

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:45.920
They're getting full of themselves just because they're a little good!

00:04:45.920 --> 00:04:46.840
Don't underestimate me!

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.510
They get past Tetsukado!

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:52.140
You call that playing soccer?

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:56.940
I still don't understand why you were chosen to be Coach.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:03.900
How do you intend to take responsibility if Inazuma Japan doesn't even make it through the prelims?!

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:05.860
I'll stop you!

00:05:07.600 --> 00:05:08.740
Make it in, Phan!

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.550
Fire Dragon has a chance to shoot!

00:05:11.550 --> 00:05:12.830
All right, come on!

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:16.950
What?!

00:05:16.950 --> 00:05:18.400
Shindou blocks it!

00:05:18.400 --> 00:05:21.420
Shindou saves the team from danger again!

00:05:22.470 --> 00:05:23.650
Again...

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:24.620
What are you doing?

00:05:24.620 --> 00:05:25.760
That was uncalled for!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.850
Hey, are you listening to me?

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.900
This is...

00:05:31.900 --> 00:05:34.250
Is Shindou-senpai...?

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.450
But even if we fight with just the three of us...

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:42.900
It's the only way we can win.

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:47.470
Tenma and Tsurugi will bring the ball up together to score points.

00:05:47.470 --> 00:05:49.150
I will stay behind to defend the goal.

00:05:49.150 --> 00:05:50.420
You, Shindou-san?

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:50.990
Yeah.

00:05:52.100 --> 00:05:56.330
I will handle all of Fire Dragon's shoots.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.250
Tenma!

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.370
This time, it's Inazuma Japan's turn to attack.

00:06:03.370 --> 00:06:05.130
Matzukaze zooms up the field!

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:06.720
I'll stop you!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:11.600
Windhole Drive!

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:16.000
Matsukaze gets through!

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:16.770
Tsurugi!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:18.810
Inazuma Japan's pass goes through!

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:22.360
Looks like a few of them <i>can</i>  play a bit decently.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:25.360
Over here!

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:26.970
Tenma!

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:34.490
Inazuma Japan quickly moves in with Matsukaze and Tsurugi's well-coordinated team play!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:37.620
Ground Running Blaze!

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:41.040
But they can't get through that easily!

00:06:42.020 --> 00:06:43.950
Now Fire Dragon attacks!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:46.090
The ball is carried promptly towards the goal!

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:50.800
But Shindou stops this again!

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:54.900
Hey... Inazuma Japan is fighting with only three of its members.

00:06:54.900 --> 00:06:57.100
I guess that's to be expected.

00:06:57.100 --> 00:07:02.770
I watched their exhibition match with the Teikoku Eleven, and the other guys are barely any use.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:04.650
Nii-chan...

00:07:05.220 --> 00:07:06.970
What are you trying to pull here?

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:10.200
You aren't planning on standing there forever, are you?!

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:13.320
Move!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.280
I'll stop the ball!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.240
Move!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:26.420
I have to do something, or this game will end without me having my moment!

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:29.600
Matsukaze moves up dribbling!

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:31.550
All right! If I can just get through there...

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:33.390
Go, Tenma!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:34.600
We won't let you!

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:40.980
Tenma!

00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:42.200
Are you okay?

00:07:42.200 --> 00:07:42.770
Yes.

00:07:43.270 --> 00:07:44.270
Thank goodness...

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:48.980
It's tough bringing the ball up with just Tsurugi and Tenma.

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:52.700
I want you to let me fight with you.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.250
What?

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:59.660
I know I'm not anywhere near the level where I can challenge the world, like you guys.

00:08:00.220 --> 00:08:03.500
But I want to reach your level, even for a little bit.

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:06.250
So, teach me how to play soccer!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.050
I know it's not something to ask during a game...

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.670
Matatagi!

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:16.700
Okay, let's do it!

00:08:16.700 --> 00:08:19.070
You're okay with that, right, Shindou-san?

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.770
It's worth giving a try.

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:23.600
Fine.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.150
The game resumes with Inazuma Japan's ball!

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:32.970
The score is still 0-0!

00:08:32.970 --> 00:08:38.120
Will Inazuma Japan tip the balance, or will it be Fire Dragon?!

00:08:39.050 --> 00:08:41.790
Matatagi, you focus too much on running quickly.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:49.750
I understand you want to make use of your speed, but I think you should first be conscious of kicking the ball with precision.

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.950
The game resumes with the throw-in by Tsurugi.

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:55.130
Matatagi!

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:58.350
It's too much force!

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.350
It's mine!

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.600
What?

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.220
Matatagi gets through!

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:10.600
That dribbling is pretty cool!

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:12.170
That's it, Nii-chan!

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:12.780
Go!

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:13.990
Captain!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:15.450
Tsurugi!

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:20.450
With the addition of Matatagi, Inazuma Japan is bringing the ball up!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.660
Now this is unexpected...

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.870
No fair! He's standing out all on his own.

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:28.630
Don't get so worked up!

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:40.550
If I just think of it as a rhythmic gymnastics ball...

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:50.250
Inazuma Japan is managing to pass the ball around!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:51.400
They're so desperate.

00:09:51.820 --> 00:09:53.690
Good, they're trying their best.

00:09:54.250 --> 00:09:56.950
Whatever could this be?

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.160
It's a change.

00:09:58.650 --> 00:10:02.530
And the ones who brought about that change are those three.

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:05.410
Over here!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.170
Tetsukado-kun, pass to Nozaki-san!

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:11.750
Over here!

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:14.220
Kusaka-kun, pass to Minaho-kun!

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:20.170
Why aren't they giving him the ball?

00:10:20.170 --> 00:10:22.470
Could it be they...?

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.470
What's wrong with them?

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:27.370
Why won't any of them pass to Matatagi?

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.440
<i>Is it true your wallet is missing?</i>

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:37.850
<i>I've heard that Matatagi-kun was once caught stealing in the past.</i>

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:41.870
<i>So you're the only one here likely enough to steal my wallet.</i>

00:10:42.450 --> 00:10:44.280
I see, it's because of that...

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:49.040
Bae Jun-ho steals the ball!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:51.540
And he centers it to Lee Chun-yoon!

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:53.650
Shindou!

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.630
I told you to move!

00:10:57.750 --> 00:11:00.170
Rapid Fire!

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:04.550
Move!

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:07.430
I'll stop it!

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:11.970
It's in!

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.980
The first point goes to Fire Dragon!

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.350
There's the whistle!

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:18.620
1-0!

00:11:18.620 --> 00:11:21.490
The first half ends with Fire Dragon in the lead!

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:24.990
We really can't expect much from this team.

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:27.950
Nii-chan...

00:11:39.150 --> 00:11:42.350
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:44.650 --> 00:11:47.670
Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy!

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.850
We almost had a good thing going just now...

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.200
What do I do...?

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:57.150
I told you, you can't come in here.

00:11:57.620 --> 00:11:59.300
Why not?!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:01.300
Unless you have some connection with the teams, you can't come in.

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:02.700
Yuuta-kun! Shun-kun!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.420
Do you know these boys?

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:06.240
They're my teammate's brothers.

00:12:06.770 --> 00:12:09.900
Why aren't you guys giving my brother the ball?!

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:12.250
Is it because he got caught stealing?

00:12:13.550 --> 00:12:15.020
People are always like that.

00:12:15.020 --> 00:12:18.590
Once they find out he stole, they all look at him with disdain.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:21.250
But that's not what really happened!

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:23.250
It wasn't him who stole, it was-

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:24.180
Stop it, Yuuta.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:26.100
Nii-chan!

00:12:26.450 --> 00:12:29.270
That's enough. Go back to your seats.

00:12:29.270 --> 00:12:31.000
But if I don't set this straight now, you'll-

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:31.680
Go back!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.170
Fine.

00:12:35.170 --> 00:12:36.060
Let's go, Shun.

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:41.850
Matatagi, could it be you're...?

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:49.820
There was more going on, wasn't there?

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:52.160
Matatagi.

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.660
Can you tell me?

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:10.850
We don't have a father.

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:18.020
He left us a long time ago, and Mom is too sick to work.

00:13:18.350 --> 00:13:23.050
My brothers must have been really hungry that day...

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:25.570
They couldn't help themselves from stealing food.

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:29.220
They were already being bullied as it is...

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:32.950
If people knew what they'd done, they'll be treated even more horribly.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:36.670
So you took the blame for them...

00:13:39.250 --> 00:13:43.760
After that, everyone stopped believing in me.

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.050
Matatagi...

00:13:50.570 --> 00:13:52.510
I don't care about what others think about me.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:56.520
I just make my plays for my brothers, and for myself.

00:13:57.220 --> 00:13:59.150
The second half is ready to begin!

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:02.100
The score is 1-0 with Fire Dragon in the lead!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.920
Will Inazuma Japan catch up?!

00:14:04.920 --> 00:14:09.030
You guys aren't qualified to be here in the first place.

00:14:10.570 --> 00:14:13.410
It's still one point! Let's get it back!

00:14:14.470 --> 00:14:17.120
The second half begins with Fire Dragon's kickoff!

00:14:17.700 --> 00:14:19.670
Matsukaze makes a sliding!

00:14:19.850 --> 00:14:21.750
Who will grab the ball first?!

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.620
It's Matatagi!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.220
He keeps the ball and dribbles up the field!

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:28.370
Go!

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.510
Nii-chan, you can do it!

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:30.800
We'll stop you!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.470
Fire Dragon goes in to stop him!

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:37.810
No one's around! Matatagi can't make his pass!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:45.600
Their team is a mess.

00:14:45.600 --> 00:14:45.980
Over here!

00:14:47.720 --> 00:14:48.490
Matatagi!

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.020
Ground Running Blaze!

00:14:56.070 --> 00:14:58.710
I can never work with him.

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:03.840
Fire Dragon's fierce attack picks up only minutes into the second half!

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.200
Tenma!

00:15:06.200 --> 00:15:06.840
Tsurugi-kun!

00:15:07.420 --> 00:15:10.350
Tenma and Tsurugi-kun are both marked.

00:15:10.350 --> 00:15:13.150
Shindou stands in front of the goal, as usual.

00:15:13.150 --> 00:15:16.010
Those two are the only ones who can move properly.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:17.470
Then I'll do it...

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:19.320
Over here!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:21.450
Good move, Matatagi!

00:15:21.450 --> 00:15:23.550
Minaho, give the ball to Matatagi!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:24.550
Manabe-kun!

00:15:24.550 --> 00:15:27.320
The ball is stolen from Inazuma Japan once again!

00:15:28.570 --> 00:15:29.970
Over here!

00:15:32.150 --> 00:15:33.520
Over here!

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.600
Matatagi...

00:15:50.250 --> 00:15:51.590
What are you guys doing?!

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:58.350
We won't win by playing this kind of soccer.

00:15:58.350 --> 00:16:00.890
Why won't you help Matatagi out?

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.150
As long as you're standing on the same field, you're friends.

00:16:04.550 --> 00:16:07.860
What's the point if you can't even trust your own teammates?!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:12.650
Matatagi is fighting with everything he has, even when he's being treated this way!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:16.450
Take a closer look at what's happening on this field!

00:16:20.720 --> 00:16:23.000
Watch me, Shun, Yuuta!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.080
I'll win this for you!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.670
Matatagi...

00:16:26.370 --> 00:16:30.420
Maybe what we thought about him was a mistake...

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:35.430
Now that I think about it, it doesn't really matter what sort of guy he is, does it?

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:01.240
Inazuma Japan's pass connects!

00:17:02.950 --> 00:17:05.000
We're going, too!

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.700
Inazuma Japan is holding back Fire Dragon's offense!

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:16.570
Who will make the next point? Inazuma Japan or Fire Dragon?!

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.640
Manabe is surrounded!

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:23.430
Manabe, over here!

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.900
Pass it to Matatagi!

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:29.440
Manabe! Do it!

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.440
Manabe!

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:32.190
Manabe-kun!

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:33.300
Pass it!

00:17:33.300 --> 00:17:34.570
Manabe-kun!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:34.970
Give it to Matatagi!

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.200
Hurry!

00:17:37.800 --> 00:17:42.040
At 30 degrees to the left, the success rate of my pass will be...

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.620
100%!

00:17:47.350 --> 00:17:49.400
That pass was made in a good spot!

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.460
I'll stop you!

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:53.050
Korea's breeze, Lee Chun-yoon, goes in to stop him!

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:55.130
Lee Chun-yoon is fast!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.630
Will Matatagi be able to outrun him?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.220
Nii-chan...

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.430
It's mine!

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:07.140
He gets through!

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:09.700
Captain!

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:14.150
With this ball that Matatagi brought to me...

00:18:14.150 --> 00:18:15.360
I'll score a goal, no matter what!

00:18:18.900 --> 00:18:20.660
God Wind!

00:18:25.300 --> 00:18:28.050
Big Explosive Slap!

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:37.920
It's in!

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.890
Inazuma Japan makes it a tie near the last moments of the game!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:43.180
All right!

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:44.260
Good job, Nii-chan!

00:18:45.820 --> 00:18:46.520
Impossible...

00:18:47.300 --> 00:18:49.220
I lost in speed?

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:51.900
But this fight is just beginning.

00:18:53.300 --> 00:18:54.400
Chun-yoon!

00:18:54.920 --> 00:18:56.610
It's given to Lee Chun-yoon!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:01.020
Rapid Fire!

00:19:03.550 --> 00:19:04.830
Shindou-senpai!

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.540
Einsatz!

00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:12.670
What?!

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:13.720
He stops it!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:16.650
Shindou blows back the hissatsu shoot!

00:19:17.720 --> 00:19:18.800
I won't let you!

00:19:20.920 --> 00:19:22.550
Z Slash!

00:19:24.800 --> 00:19:26.800
All right! Good job, Tenma!

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:27.720
Tsurugi!

00:19:29.150 --> 00:19:30.600
Leave it to me!

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:33.850
Devil Burst!

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:41.860
It's in!

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:45.740
The match is over!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:48.350
Inazuma Japan turns the score around!

00:19:48.650 --> 00:19:51.920
All right! We did it, we won!

00:19:56.700 --> 00:19:58.170
What is this...

00:19:58.170 --> 00:19:59.170
Is this for real?

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.930
It was just as I expected.

00:20:02.600 --> 00:20:04.270
We won?

00:20:04.270 --> 00:20:06.050
We won.

00:20:06.450 --> 00:20:08.970
I did it, Shun, Yuuta.

00:20:08.970 --> 00:20:10.850
I did it.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.300
We won, Matatagi!

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:15.420
Let's keep doing our best together, okay?

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:16.300
Okay.

00:20:16.300 --> 00:20:17.020
Guys!

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:20.360
What a simple guy.

00:20:21.000 --> 00:20:23.400
We actually won with this team...

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:33.250
Matatagi did steal it, and no mistake!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.450
Maybe you stuck it in your jersey pocket and forgot since you don't normally wear a jersey.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.920
I wouldn't forget something like tha-

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.800
Did you see that?

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:51.870
You'd better apologize to Matatagi!

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.640
O-Okay...

00:21:08.220 --> 00:21:11.700
I was not expecting you to win the first round.

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:16.710
The Inazuma Japan that I have chosen will never fail.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:24.470
I do wonder where that confidence of yours comes from.

00:22:54.550 --> 00:22:57.810
Inazuma Japan's members are beginners at soccer.

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:00.810
My attributes as Captain are now put to the test!

00:23:00.810 --> 00:23:03.170
Next, The Enigma of the Team's Formation!

00:23:03.170 --> 00:23:05.570
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:19.750
The Inazuma Eleven GO Galaxy's proverb today is...

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:25.520
As long as you're standing on the same field, you're friends.

00:23:25.520 --> 00:23:26.300
That's all!
